IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CHECK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N0 USAGE POINTER.
01 N1 USAGE POINTER.
01 N2 USAGE POINTER.
01 N3 USAGE POINTER.
01 N3-V PIC X(48) VALUE "nested first line" & X"0A" & "  indented" & X"0A" & X"0A" & "nested last line" & X"0A" & X"00".
01 N1-K PIC X(6) VALUE "outer" & X"00".
01 N-STATUS PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 MY-DATA USAGE POINTER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateObject" RETURNING N0.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N1.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N2.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N3-V RETURNING N3.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N2 BY VALUE N3 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N1 BY VALUE N2 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToObject" USING BY VALUE N0 BY REFERENCE N1-K BY VALUE N1 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    SET MY-DATA TO N0.
    STOP RUN.
